{"consumableId":"10392381","bookId":8662702,"title":"Mördare utan ansikte","originalTitle":"","language":"sv","description":"En natt i januari mördas ett äldre bondepar i Skåne. Med sina sista andetag yttrar kvinnan ordet ”utländsk”. Kort därefter brinner stadens flyktingförläggning och en somalisk flykting mördas. Kommissarie Kurt Wallander tar upp kampen mot en hänsynslös mördare.\n\nHenning Mankells ikoniska Wallanderserie är översatt till över 40 språk och har blivit både svensk och internationell tv- och filmserie. Mördare utan ansikte är första boken i den berömda serien om kommissarie Kurt Wallander. Här i Stefan Sauks originalinspelning.","shareUrl":"https://storytel.com/se/books/mördare-utan-ansikte-10392381?utm_source=internal&utm_medium=app_link&utm_campaign=share_links","isAbridged":false,"audiobookSampleUrl":"https://api.storytel.net/assets/consumables/10392381/abook/preview","trailerData":null,"ratings":{"averageRating":3.96,"numberOfRatings":274},"cover":{"url":"https://covers.storytel.com/jpg-640/9789113139890.3c38ad75-833b-463b-8556-286443204db3?optimize=high","width":640,"height":640},"category":{"name":"Crime","deepLink":"storytel://inspirational-page/explore/pages/sweden-crime-category-page/"},"authors":[{"id":"76","name":"Henning Mankell","deepLink":"storytel://vertical-list/explore/lists/authors/76","avatarImage":null}],"narrators":[{"id":"5","name":"Stefan Sauk","deepLink":"storytel://vertical-list/explore/lists/narrators/5","avatarImage":{"url":"https://covers.storytel.com/contributor/5/dee311f4-ae21-4316-897f-af4b93cf0a5f.jpg?optimize=high","width":640,"height":640}}],"translators":[],"seriesInfo":{"id":"42960","name":"Wallander","orderInSeries":1,"deepLink":"storytel://vertical-list/explore/lists/series/42960"},"duration":{"hours":9,"minutes":7,"seconds":38},"formats":[{"id":"8834956","type":"ebook","releaseDate":"2024-07-18T00:00:00Z","availabilityInfo":[{"isReleased":true,"releaseDate":"2024-07-18T00:00:00Z","type":"subscription"}],"isGeo